1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,790
I followed your orders and saved
over 2,000 people, Williams,

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,720
even though Dufraisne
took it out on me and Enrica.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,780
Then he sent you to Russia.

4
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,880
He needed a tanker.

5
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,490
Didn't say why.

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,010
A smuggling ship was trapped
in the ice in the Sea of Okhotsk.

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:19,280
They dropped me in to clear the area
and secure the tanker for them.

8
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,440
I never want to see another ship again.
